# T05 - CONVERT in the wrong thesis state
PROGRAM 20 3 5.00 12 0
COURSE TH1 THESIS 8 CORE -
COURSE CS101 REGULAR 4 CORE -
STUDENT R1 Asha
REGISTER R1 TH1 1
REGISTER R1 CS101 1
CONVERT R1 TH1 A
GRADE R1 TH1 1 B
CONVERT R1 CS101 A
CONVERT R1 TH1 Q
GRADE R1 TH1 1 X
CONVERT R1 TH1 A
CONVERT R1 TH9 A
CONVERT R9 TH1 A
GPA R1
